<title>UK: CRICKET-GLOUCESTERSHIRE 55-1 V AUSTRALIA (249) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GLOUCESTERSHIRE 55-1 V AUSTRALIA (249) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, England 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gloucestershire, replying to Australia's first innings total of 249, were 55 for one at the close on the first day of their three-day match on Tuesday.</p>
